    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somebodies have stolen our four drawings, and placed in four heavily guarded towers, so we want an <strong>elite</strong> controller to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control A bot,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through a dangerous path,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get into a vault,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and Take the drawings back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spec. of the bot you can control is follow:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bot can catch chain to move up and down, also the bot can use the chain to perform a swinging to jump higher or farther:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/6811e0ed7f953e08f09acd040d16ce59.avif?t=1746638321\" width=186 height=382 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bot is equipped with a launcher which can fire plungers or a chain with suckers:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/e80c151e9bf316292797d9d9f5315e24.avif?t=1746638321\" width=430 height=378 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunger can temporary shut down some enemies, in order to help the bot to pass through some area:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/256101a42b7343f329f2d8cf1c05a21a.avif?t=1746638321\" width=168 height=160 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 5 sets of outlook for the bot, total 625 combination can be selected:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/9a9ff62b51e28ba06e0e277a96de2a15.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/50a6e6a1adc269344e2952633d298a28.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/34ee009705e2ffd2b118ddf61dc399bc.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/71cae026886afceb85c41ea4266374f8.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/b625707e9a2b2a057d40e2f3556d80d9.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to accept this challenge? If so, <u>download</u> the interface and <u>start</u>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somebodies have stolen our four drawings, and placed in four heavily guarded towers, so we want an <strong>elite</strong> controller to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control A bot,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through a dangerous path,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get into a vault,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and Take the drawings back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spec. of the bot you can control is follow:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bot can catch chain to move up and down, also the bot can use the chain to perform a swinging to jump higher or farther:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/6811e0ed7f953e08f09acd040d16ce59.avif?t=1746638321\" width=186 height=382 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bot is equipped with a launcher which can fire plungers or a chain with suckers:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/e80c151e9bf316292797d9d9f5315e24.avif?t=1746638321\" width=430 height=378 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunger can temporary shut down some enemies, in order to help the bot to pass through some area:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/256101a42b7343f329f2d8cf1c05a21a.avif?t=1746638321\" width=168 height=160 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 5 sets of outlook for the bot, total 625 combination can be selected:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/9a9ff62b51e28ba06e0e277a96de2a15.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/50a6e6a1adc269344e2952633d298a28.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/34ee009705e2ffd2b118ddf61dc399bc.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/71cae026886afceb85c41ea4266374f8.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877890/extras/b625707e9a2b2a057d40e2f3556d80d9.avif?t=1746638321\" width=192 height=256 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to accept this challenge? If so, <u>download</u> the interface and <u>start</u>.</p>",
